{"id":"suai-report","name":"suai-report","aliases":[],"caption":"Reports for Saint Petersburg State University of Aerospace Instrumentation","authors":[{"id":"moiseev","active":true}],"copyright":[{"owner":"Grigorii Moiseev","year":"2026"}],"license":"mit","version":{"number":"2.7","date":"2026-10-05"},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n      This package typesets student reports (lab works,\n      coursework, practice reports) for Saint Petersburg\n      State University of Aerospace Instrumentation (SUAI,\n      ГУАП) according to the Russian standards\n      GOST 7.32-2017 and GOST 2.105-2019.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      The title page reproduces the official university form.\n      Page layout, headings, table of contents, captions,\n      numbered tables, figures, equations, listings, appendices\n      and the list of sources are set up automatically.\n      Line-based block commands (<code>\\suaitasks<\u002fcode>,\n      <code>\\suaitable<\u002fcode>, <code>\\suaieq<\u002fcode>,\n      <code>\\suaisources<\u002fcode> and others) keep the document\n      source short: every line becomes a list item, a table row\n      or an explanation of a symbol.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      The package requires XeLaTeX.\n      Times New Roman, Liberation Sans and Liberation Mono are\n      used when installed, otherwise\n      <ref refid=\"tex-gyre-termes\">TeX Gyre Termes<\u002fref>,\n      <ref refid=\"tex-gyre-heros\">Heros<\u002fref> and\n      <ref refid=\"tex-gyre-cursor\">Cursor<\u002fref>.\n      Documentation is in Russian.\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/suai-report/README.md"},{"language":"ru","details":"Example of use","href":"ctan:/macros/xetex/latex/suai-report/suai-report-demo.pdf"}],"bugs":"https://github.com/Echways/suai-report/issues","repository":"https://github.com/Echways/suai-report","ctan":{"path":"/macros/xetex/latex/suai-report","file":true},"miktex":"suai-report","texlive":"suai-report","topics":["std-conform","report-like","russian","doc-templ","xetex"]}